{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：03:15 2026-10-25 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"48位K-Pop偶像罕有同框拍攝  為D社大型沉浸式藝術展拍攝宣傳片及海報\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/61b4a15bdb1bc91ad7e43d39d1a6e536/2026-10/cats_117.jpg\"/>\n<p>韓國最強八卦媒體《Dispatch》（D社）除了擅於踢爆巨星戀情之外，也擁有強大號召力。好像他們最近舉行為期1個月的K-POP展覽《D’FESTA THE ORIGIN》，就邀得48位K-Pop巨星為展覽，最厲害是這次企劃並非巨星們各自進行拍攝、然後合成製作，而是48名巨星同時集結，星光熠熠，令人咋舌！</p>\n<h2>K-POP藝術特展於汝矣島舉行</h2>\n<p>今次應邀現身拍攝的巨星包括：G-Dragon（GD）、BTS、Stray Kids、TXT（TOMORROW X TOGETHER）、IVE、aespa、ENHYPEN、RIIZE、CORTIS等知名K-Pop藝人及人氣韓團。在宣傳片中，他們48人逐個從後台走出來，然後齊齊站定擺好甫士，看48名巨星合體的墟冚場面，教觀眾睇到目瞪口呆！早前D社公開展覽海報時，大家都以為是巨星們逐一拍攝再合成變海報。但日前宣傳片公開後，大家才發現是48位巨星難得同框一起拍攝，超壯觀畫面頓成熱話，更登上微博熱搜三甲。D社這次舉辦大型沉浸式的K-POP藝術特展，以「打開新世界的感性」為概念，邀請48位K-Pop巨星共襄盛舉，展覽由即日起於首爾汝矣島IFC Mall L3・MPX GALLERY舉行後，展期到11月30日結束。</p>\n<img alt=\"韓國最強八卦媒體《Dispatch》舉行大型韓國最強八卦媒體《Dispatch》，邀得48位巨星拍攝海報。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/2bf2b23c021d95d059e804666462e676/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_17_11_16.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"D社日前公開展覽宣傳片，48位巨星難得同框，數人都數到眼花撩亂！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/08625fe0f1545c40108b329ebee530ec/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_17_11_35.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"作為BIGBANG隊長兼K-Pop大前輩，GD打頭陣登場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/e812fb1a5aa89e77c780068ceb37eade/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_17_12_00.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"BTS成員Jungkook。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/715bddfd03ba09e6822a82b124a6675a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_17_12_15.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"BTS成員V。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/9ff8960972499653d5564b43766774ff/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_17_12_30.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"BTS成員Jin。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/81c1d7a6d057a060bcee9960c673151a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_17_12_47.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Stray Kids成員Felix。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/7721e6560be723d6930c86faf1b0d7f8/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_17_13_03.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Stray Kids隊長方燦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/48d2a7d70e501ae0f48e9a47cc3d9ee8/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_17_13_17.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Stray Kids成員鉉辰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/792c9baa3cd795aa9e293438c952df04/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_17_13_32.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"CORTIS台灣成員James。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/85b33669fd0dbd19da4c605cfe78aefe/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_17_13_49.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"CORTIS成員KEONHO。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/804119d73b408343062449ef69087ebb/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_17_14_05.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"TXT隊長崔秀彬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/901edc07d3b5e3ae4db5844ea9ff718a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_17_14_21.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"aespa隊長Karina。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/c59f73bc38a28bde58a3d72008ae8c11/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_17_14_36.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"aespa成員Winter。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/1c64a9e76e433946407af557c8494052/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_17_14_52.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"aespa成員Giselle。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/bc13f258152d3d8a4f6282d57db2544c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_17_16_36.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"aespa中國成員Ningning。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/0092ed9eb80485056b1dc8a009f92e05/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_17_16_55_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"IVE成員張員瑛\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/d9efdbd2b716d26f53ceaf2e11e535f6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_17_17_09.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"IVE隊長安俞真。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/e38756e81116511c5934e6286c2b83ae/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_17_17_25_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"IVE成員金秋天。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/560851821af4c0ba17ae2ccae1e6f6c3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_17_17_40.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T19:40:44.922080+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":550,"images":20,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T19:15:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T02:38:19.139756+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T19:38:10.816467+00:00","content_hash":"6bf9ee48988ed91db37eb46bd06a068464e01680ea2c317ae8fd36e4102c0fb8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}